{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_title", "source_sha256": "96ffc8da9f728695107c6b0393c0bae800e5c1a31f6e9beb8f778e1ae1293fcb", "ja": "打ち上げも全力で", "zh": "庆功宴也要全力以赴", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5b4818049f0199ffb2a8d6e38cab8f1ab240b6544a0b6581d50e220c89abe506", "ja": "集大成ライブの打ち上げで牛タンを堪能した\n真、瑞希、千鶴、エレナ。お腹はいっぱいだ\nけど、まだまだ気になるものが……お土産に\nすればいいと言うエレナに皆が賛同し、買い\n物タイムが始まった。", "zh": "集大成演唱会的庆功宴上，真、瑞希、千鹤和艾蕾娜尽情享用了牛舌。虽然已经吃饱了，但还有不少让人在意的东西……艾蕾娜提议可以买些当特产，大家都表示赞同，于是购物时间开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "0267fa997e34b62121087075161967b561b0ca2305a02d2b0b6527613590e70b", "ja": "打ち上げの牛タン、おいしかった～！　でも、ライブの\n後とはいえ、さすがに食べすぎちゃったかな？", "zh": "庆功宴上的牛舌真好吃～！不过，虽说是在演出之后，我是不是还是吃得有点太多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "08ce3d0d4b373bae7cc0e419e417032cc7801b57937670e88763a02a0a3048e2", "ja": "菊地さん、気にしなくても大丈夫です。\nここにいる全員、2皿以上おかわりしましたから。", "zh": "菊地小姐，不用在意的。\n在场的所有人，都至少续了2盘呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "66f297027f6d0cc2ec3717cd386cd90dda92ecc0df5cfa3db818251565ece444", "ja": "せり鍋も、いいお味でしたわ。\n鴨肉とせりがあんなに合うだなんて……。", "zh": "水芹火锅的味道也很不错呢。没想到鸭肉和水芹竟然这么搭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "d1e68b0bc8b51df18f4ed82fab2076062ea4eafd9748f0013f5b2ef20ef6e865", "ja": "シメのおそばもおいしかったネ～！　お鍋って、\nみんなでワイワイ食べられるから大好きだヨ～！", "zh": "最后的荞麦面也很好吃呢～！火锅就是因为能和大家热热闹闹地一起吃，所以最喜欢啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6069b1eabda46232f5b86245568478fe76a0768938a3f188f8059b1e91133838", "ja": "（打ち上げの予算は、とっくに超えてしまったが……\nみんなの満足そうな顔が見られて良かったな！）", "zh": "（虽然庆功宴的预算早就超支了……不过能看到大家满足的笑脸，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "a7c318431691548bba49282afe4460be82e962fa6651418eb53d60d017969ec6", "ja": "それにしても……こうして通りを歩いてると、\n気になるものがどんどん増えていっちゃうなぁ。", "zh": "话说回来……像这样走在街上，感兴趣的东西越来越多了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "1388ea4bf31872166f53def40d0aaae8508a2ea91a44b8a8318191b20818c579", "ja": "わかりますわ。お店によって、牛タンの味も\n違うでしょうし。食べ比べをしたいところですが……。", "zh": "我明白。不同店铺的牛舌，味道应该也各不相同吧。真想逐一品尝比较一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "b8372904ac7e530b845cd354ac97e34f86a7605e06d2cb12101c8cfbaa14a990", "ja": "さすがに、これ以上はお腹に入りそうに\nありません。……真壁選手、ギブアップです。", "zh": "不管怎么说，肚子里也实在塞不下更多了。……真壁选手，认输了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "029a963130bde66a8feb6c47c6dc9d107176efd2296454af4a5795eeb3bceac7", "ja": "ワタシもお腹いっぱいかナ～。\nあ、だったらお土産に追加するのはどう？", "zh": "我也吃得差不多了呢～。\n啊，那要不要再买点当伴手礼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "667f977fb43cd754ec3566061972e7b166b8855f4c0c1581c9f7e4b03e01c143", "ja": "えっ？\nみんな、お土産はもう買ったんじゃ……？", "zh": "诶？\n大家不是已经买过伴手礼了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "0d2840304e98fa0f234b1b5a27cf5f9cb707a015975413320d334e6099ac9b0b", "ja": "そうなんだけど……北東エリア、\nおいしそうなものが多すぎるんだヨ～！", "zh": "是这样没错……可是东北地区好吃的东西也太多了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "a96e0fd79c00ac26a2087e5c2229ee0bd913d606d41194c320298fa8f79ae797", "ja": "それならボクも、さっきのお店が見たいな！\nずんだに合いそうなお茶が売ってたんだ。", "zh": "那我也想去看看刚才那家店！  \n那里卖着看起来很适合配毛豆泥的茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "41c200f717cd1688a3e76f1364c1cbc793257263adae7d4ad8af60ce2f025401", "ja": "あら、良いですわね。{$P$}、\n時間の方は、まだ大丈夫ですの？", "zh": "哎呀，听起来不错呢。{$P$}，时间还来得及吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8fa4fae708b6163d2b2a719dd258ef734867b36adf891f11da1ae00187993aa5", "ja": "え、ええ。時間は大丈夫ですよ。\n時間は……。", "zh": "呃、嗯。时间还来得及。时间方面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "b334b1694d65860a0487e846709cdaac6ad99ae887974a32a4a02a28518d5f10", "ja": "では、今からお土産タイムです。『元祖冷やし\n中華セット』。……佐竹さんには、これだな。", "zh": "那么，现在是特产时间。『元祖冷面套装』。……佐竹小姐的话，就这个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_epi02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_epi02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0b7b3d4f05549d597214e8b62af8f07fd18e949debfdc32154fb5e27594df7ca", "ja": "（ここまで来たら最後まで、か……。ツアーを\nやり切ったご褒美として、大盤振る舞いだ！）", "zh": "（既然都走到这一步了，那就坚持到最后吗……作为完成巡演的奖励，就大方地庆祝一番吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
